// This Pine Script® code is subject to the terms of the Mozilla Public License 2.0 at https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/
// Draft – not published (MERGED: volatility-spike exclusion)
// Grid-Fit Screener (companion to "Crypto Grid Strategy v2"). Educational use only.
// The grid-fit score is a descriptive 0-100 number built from HISTORICAL data (regime, volatility, range containment,
// midline crossings, liquidity). It is not a probability or a forecast of any outcome.
// Repaint control: request.security(..., lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_off) and every value is taken from the
// previous fully closed bar ([1]) inside the requested context; the alert fires once per bar close.
//@version=6
indicator("Grid-Fit Screener – Draft", shorttitle = "GridFit", overlay = false)

string G_S = "Symbols (36 request.security calls – limit is 40 per script)"
string G_P = "Scoring"
string G_A = "Alert"

